{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-30770-r4613683","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Carrot Paprika Spread","sourcePageId":30770,"sourceRevision":"4613683","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2026-01-26T02:24:31Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Carrot%20Paprika%20Spread&oldid=4613683","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:35:13.004Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using carrot","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:Recipes using oat","Category:Recipes using prepared mustard","Category:Recipes using spelt flour","Category:Recipes using tofu","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Vegan recipes","Category:Very Easy recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"124b52c164df5ff26cd470ab4aa53459172122540a9bc0fb03d8921a29d8e00d","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Vegan recipes|yield=1 bowl|time=15 minutes|difficulty=1}}\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Vegan_cuisine|Vegan Cuisine]] | [[Cookbook:Breakfast_Recipes|Breakfast]]\n\n'''Carrot paprika spread''' is a spread consisting of tofu and oat flakes.\n\n==Ingredients==\n*250g [[Cookbook:Oats|oat]] flakes (or raw [[cookbook:spelt|spelt]] flour)\n*250g [[cookbook:tofu|tofu]]\n*1 (or more) [[cookbook:carrot|carrot]](s)\n*1 (or more) [[cookbook:Paprika|paprika]](s) (may substitute with [[Cookbook:Bell Pepper|red bell peppers]], [[Cookbook:Pepperoncini|sweet peppers]])\n*1 (or more) [[cookbook:onion|onion]](s)\n*[[cookbook:margarine|Margarine]]\n*[[cookbook:Canola Oil|Rapeseed oil]] or other [[cookbook:Vegetable Oil|vegetable oil]]\n*[[cookbook:Soy Sauce|Soy sauce]]\n*[[cookbook:mustard|Mustard]]\n*[[cookbook:Ketchup|Catsup]]\n*[[cookbook:garlic|garlic]]\n*[[cookbook:pepper|pepper]]\n*Soy lecithin powder\n\n==Procedure==\n# Combine the oat flakes and tofu with some water to make the base. You might want to add lecithin powder as an emulsifier.\n# Mash carrot, paprika, and onion. If you prefer larger pieces you can also cut some of it instead.\n# Add a spoon of margarine and/or a spoon of rapeseed oil.\n# Add mustard, catsup, garlic, and pepper to taste.\n\n[[Category:Vegan recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tofu|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using oat|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using spelt flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]\n[[Category:Recipes using prepared mustard]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Carrot Paprika Spread","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"250g oat flakes (or raw spelt flour)","sourceText":"250g oat flakes (or raw spelt flour)","amountText":"250g oat flakes (or raw spelt flour)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"250g tofu","sourceText":"250g tofu","amountText":"250g tofu","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 (or more) carrot(s)","sourceText":"1 (or more) carrot(s)","amountText":"1 (or more) carrot(s)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 (or more) paprika(s) (may substitute with red bell peppers, sweet peppers)","sourceText":"1 (or more) paprika(s) (may substitute with red bell peppers,